summary:
  StreamKind says it is free while its question waits for the player to
  play.

history:
  The loudness helper would go out first and the question after it, two
  connections beside the start's own.

target:
  package/contents/ui/StreamKind.qml

find:
      readonly property bool busy: _seq >= 0 || _waitUrl !== ""

replace:
      readonly property bool busy: _seq >= 0

expect:
  Killed by tests/qml/tst_streamkind.qml::test_it_says_so_while_its_question_stands.
  Line-neutral.
